                    <h2>7. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
                    <p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies (such as web beacons and local storage) to enhance your browsing experience, remember preferences, and analyze website traffic. Cookies are small data files stored on your device. We use the following categories of cookies:</p>
                    <ul>
